# Print typography

Set printed Civica documents, such as a household handover, in Roboto at sizes that are easy to read on paper.

<h2 id="bg-typ-06">Set type for print</h2>

Use these smallest sizes:

| Element | Smallest size |
| --- | --- |
| Headings | 16pt |
| Body text | 12pt |

Use bigger text if the reader needs it. Print a test page and read it, because a page that looks fine on screen can be too small on paper.

Use the household's own name for the document. It does not need a Civica logo.

A reading on paper needs its unit, its sign and the time it was taken, as on a dashboard. [Web-app typography](typography-web-app.html#bg-typ-03) explains how. [Print colours](colour-print.html) gives the colours for printed documents.

